{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/790837-hosts-of-the-north","id":790837,"title":"Hosts of the North","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-22T06:58:44-08:00","id":790837,"title":"Hosts of the North","content":"I plan to run <b>Werewolf</b> game in Scandinavia, probably Sweden. After seeing idea of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/790655-zibhesi-the-red-plague-the-heart-drinkers-the-mosquito-hosts\">Mosquito Host</a>, I would wanted to add at least one local Host that Uratha hunt for. But North is very cold and no suitable body horror animal I can think of. Maybe you have some ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-22-2015, 04:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-22T10:15:49-08:00","id":790906,"title":"","content":"Hosts are generally vermin. Is there an iconic vermin you can draw from?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-22T10:18:53-08:00","id":790907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/790837-hosts-of-the-north?p=790906#post790906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hosts are generally vermin. Is there an iconic vermin you can draw from?</div> </div> </div> </div>Rats. Bloody rats.<br /> <br /> The latin name of Black Rat (plague rat) is &quot;Rattus Norvegicus&quot; - Norwegian rat.<br /> <br /> The Black Death spread through Scandinavia from Norwegian harbours.<br /> <br /> So yeah. Beshilu. Tons of the bastards.<br /> <br /> <br /> Oh, and I'll also point out that we have TONS of mosquitoes up here. They aren't disease-carriers, but we have LOTS of them. It's not too cold for either of them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LCmUK4EaO7Y\" data-code=\"LCmUK4EaO7Y\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/LCmUK4EaO7Y/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> This video is in Swedish, but you don't need to understand them to see. Warning, it you are afraid of mosquitoes, don't watch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":585,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","user":"Seidmadr","date":".  Adding video 12-22-2015, 01:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-22T10:47:16-08:00","id":790921,"title":"","content":"Also Crows. Halaku, the crow hosts seem like a viable addition. I mean they have a strong presence in Nordic and Scandinavian mythology, and there's already some write up in The Predators book, though I forget how much or how little. The Halaku swallow eyeballs, which is all I remember about them, and that's pretty messed up.<br /> <br /> And yeah, whatever everyone else said.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T00:44:00-08:00","id":791406,"title":"","content":"The Halaku watch and learn...<br /> So let's make them darker; now they will rip the knowledge from their victims, consuming their thoughts and memories. The dead hold no secrets from them, for the carrion-feeders learn as they sate their hunger. They have used this knowledge to rally the unquiet dead to their cause (whatever that may be). As the patient stalkers they are, they will bide their time until you are at your lowest before swooping down to blind you, figuratively and literally. These defilers of the dead have no honour, and so shall strike at your allies will you are distracted and at you as you learn of what they have done.<br /> Beware those who have lost an eye to these shartha, for eyes are the windows to the soul...lose both and you belong to them in body as well as spirit.<br /> <br /> They will come for you, mind, body &amp; soul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T01:02:48-08:00","id":791415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/790837-hosts-of-the-north?p=791406#post791406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Halaku watch and learn...<br /> So let's make them darker</div> </div> </div> </div>See page 271 of the 2e core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T01:53:24-08:00","id":791432,"title":"","content":"Ah, my apologises...still there doesn't appear to be anything that opposes my ideas, so time to combine them! Yay! Murder Houses and phaegic feasting for all!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T03:17:17-08:00","id":791458,"title":"","content":"If there are rats, fleas would also be prevalent. It just so happens I am working on a Flea Host- I've always wanted there to be host that inverts the status quo. Uratha don't typically hunt the fleas, the fleas hunt Uratha... and cause them to murder those they love due to forced Death Rage transmitted through their tiny bites.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T23:46:42-08:00","id":792018,"title":"","content":"This:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/790837-hosts-of-the-north?p=791406#post791406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Halaku watch and learn...<br /> So let's make them darker; now they will rip the knowledge from their victims, consuming their thoughts and memories. The dead hold no secrets from them, for the carrion-feeders learn as they sate their hunger. They have used this knowledge to rally the unquiet dead to their cause (whatever that may be). As the patient stalkers they are, they will bide their time until you are at your lowest before swooping down to blind you, figuratively and literally. These defilers of the dead have no honour, and so shall strike at your allies will you are distracted and at you as you learn of what they have done.<br /> Beware those who have lost an eye to these shartha, for eyes are the windows to the soul...lose both and you belong to them in body as well as spirit.<br /> <br /> They will come for you, mind, body &amp; soul.</div> </div> </div> </div>And this (quote from the book):<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/790837-hosts-of-the-north?p=791415#post791415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See page 271 of the 2e core.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gave me this idea for Host for the Halaku, Basiclly, it looked like that...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/4b/48/56/4b485629bdc7aee2bc7f722d1504ad98.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> In modern times it can also look like this...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/ee/86/0f/ee860fa2d9f0676a6d65ed9ea7aa6f39.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> This legend needed to start from somewhere... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}